---
description: Use @/ path alias for imports instead of relative paths
alwaysApply: true
---

# Global imports (`@/`)

Always use the `@/` path alias (maps to `src/`). Do **not** use relative imports (`./`, `../`).

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
import { cn } from "../lib/utils";
import { SiteHeader } from "./site-header";

// ✅ GOOD
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
import { SiteHeader } from "@/components/site-header";
```

Exceptions: CSS modules in the same folder may use `./file.module.css`.
